 /8\", \"evidence\": \"S102_residual_trap\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"S103\", \"group_id\": \"G003\", \"description\": \"Guess sensitivity: n=25, e=20, guesses 1, 5, 10; expect first-update results 13, 5, 6.25. Detects an internally substituted guess.\", \"graded\": true, \"max_points\": 1, \"visibility\": \"instructor_only\", \"requirement_ids\": [\"REQ008\", \"REQ002\", \"REQ003\", \"REQ004\"], \"pass_rule\": \"Uses the supplied guess in each run; first-update results are 13, 5, 6.25 respectively.\", \"runs\": [{\"id\": \"r1\", \"input_tokens\": [\"25\", \"1\", \"20\"], \"input_description\": \"n=25, s=1, e=20.\", \"expected_result\": {\"value\": \"13\", \"basis\": \"explicit_exact\", \"oracle_requirement_ids\": []}, \"expected_behaviour\": [\"First-update result 13\"], \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S103_guess_sensitivity: Use n = 25, e = 20, and guesses 1, 5, and 10. Expect first-update results 13, 5, and 6.25.\"}]}, {\"id\": \"r2\", \"input_tokens\": [\"25\", \"5\", \"20\"], \"input_description\": \"n=25, s=5, e=20.\", \"expected_result\": {\"value\": \"5\", \"basis\": \"explicit_exact\", \"oracle_requirement_ids\": []}, \"expected_behaviour\": [\"First-update result 5\"], \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S103_guess_sensitivity: ... Expect first-update results 13, 5, and 6.25.\"}]}, {\"id\": \"r3\", \"input_tokens\": [\"25\", \"10\", \"20\"], \"input_description\": \"n=25, s=10, e=20.\", \"expected_result\": {\"value\": \"6.25\", \"basis\": \"explicit_exact\", \"oracle_requirement_ids\": []}, \"expected_behaviour\": [\"First-update result 6.25\"], \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S103_guess_sensitivity: ... Expect first-update results 13, 5, and 6.25.\"}]}], \"generation_spec\": null, \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S103_guess_sensitivity\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"S104\", \"group_id\": \"G003\", \"description\": \"Tolerance used: n=16, s=2, first with e=3 and then with e=1; expect 5 and approximately 4.1. Detects a hard-coded tolerance or iteration count.\", \"graded\": true, \"max_points\": 1, \"visibility\": \"instructor_only\", \"requirement_ids\": [\"REQ003\", \"REQ004\"], \"pass_rule\": \"Uses the supplied tolerance in the stopping rule; results are 5 and approximately 4.1.\", \"runs\": [{\"id\": \"r1\", \"input_tokens\": [\"16\", \"2\", \"3\"], \"input_description\": \"n=16, s=2, e=3.\", \"expected_result\": {\"value\": \"5\", \"basis\": \"explicit_exact\", \"oracle_requirement_ids\": []}, \"expected_behaviour\": [\"Stops after first update (change 3 <= 3)\", \"Returns 5\"], \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S104_tolerance_used: Use n = 16, s = 2, first with e = 3 and then with e = 1. Expect 5 and approximately 4.1.\"}]}, {\"id\": \"r2\", \"input_tokens\": [\"16\", \"2\", \"1\"], \"input_description\": \"n=16, s=2, e=1.\", \"expected_result\": {\"value\": \"4.1\", \"basis\": \"explicit_approximate\", \"oracle_requirement_ids\": []}, \"expected_behaviour\": [\"Continues past first update\", \"Returns approximately 4.1\"], \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S104_tolerance_used: ... Expect 5 and approximately 4.1. Detects a hard-coded tolerance or iteration count.\"}]}], \"generation_spec\": null, \"sources\": [{\"page\": 4, \"section\": \"Secret tests /8\", \"evidence\": \"S104_tolerance_used\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"S105\", \"group_id\": \"G003\", \"description\": \"Small scale: (1e-8, 1, 1e-10); compare against the iterative oracle with the published allowance. Detects zero shortcuts and coarse stopping rules.\", \"graded\": true, \"max_points\": 1, \"visibility\": \"instructor_only\", \"requirement_ids\": [\"REQ001\", \"REQ003\", \"REQ004\", \"REQ029\"], \"pass_rule\": \"Result matches the iterative oracle within the published comparison allowance.\", \"runs\": [